2026-11-07T04:02:16.9929232Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9929568Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9930327Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9931152Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9931817Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9932131Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9932445Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9932893Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9933353Z    /root
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9946121Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9946972Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9958554Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9959325Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9959833Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9960951Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9961639Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9980491Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9981147Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9992006Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9992923Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9993359Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9993589Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9993925Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9994275Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9994488Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9994918Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9995185Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9995301Z If you would like to
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9995574Z see the output, try like this:
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9996334Z 
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9996567Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9997004Z   $ sh ./install-nix
2026-11-07T04:02:16.9997168Z 
